prompts.lava:
Use case: stylized-concept. Asset type: production pixel-art asset board for a 2D side-scrolling fantasy action game, NOT a mockup or poster.
Create one exactly 1536x1024 PNG asset board, genuine transparent canvas outside designated artwork. Consistent exquisite handcrafted 16-bit pixel art, strong tasteful silhouettes, clustered pixels, deliberate 2-pixel logical grid, crisp stepped contours, no blur, no smooth painting, no text/grid/labels/shadows beneath characters.

STRICT LAYOUT: TOP HALF rectangle x0..1535 y0..511: a fully opaque 3:1 panoramic distant LAVA CITADEL background. Spectacular dark basalt cathedral cavern with monumental eroded arches, receding ribbed pillars, obsidian volcanic rock, distant molten river and hanging ember smoke, depth through 3 discrete color planes, rich burgundy shadow, restrained amber reflections. Side-view orthographic game backdrop, no foreground walkway or floating platforms, no monsters or UI. Keep bottom third and center of backdrop quieter/darker for readable gameplay; detailed scenery chiefly at distant sides and upper arches. Paint this entire top rectangle, with a completely straight bottom cutoff at y512.

BOTTOM HALF y512..1023: transparent sprite area with SIX NORMAL MONSTERS in the left 3 columns x0..383,384..767,768..1151 and 2 rows y512..767,768..1023. Center each whole creature within its own cell, at least32px transparent gutter on every side, faces/attacks toward LEFT, side view with slight three-quarter volume. One monster per cell in reading order:
1 molten ember slime with semi-translucent lava innards and bright cracked obsidian shell;
2 wiry ash imp, angular bat wings, bone horns, coal-black limbs and ember eyes;
3 massive squat basalt golem, interlocking jagged armor slabs, luminous fissures and heavy stone hands;
4 low flame lizard, expressive eye, tapering curled tail, ember dorsal fins;
5 muscular lava hound with layered dark fur, blazing mane and articulated paws;
6 sinister obsidian mage in elaborate charred robes, mask, staff topped with a small crystal ember.

RIGHTMOST COLUMN x1152..1535 y512..1023: ONE whole boss, Molten Colossus, a regal monstrous armored volcanic giant with an asymmetrical spiked crown, gigantic basalt gauntlets, radiant molten heart and deep layered rocky armor. Center the full silhouette in that entire 384x512 cell, 28px margins, more intricate and imposing than normals, facing LEFT. No scenery or floor beneath any monster. Every silhouette isolated, alpha outside.
All 7 monsters must be visibly different, expressive, expertly shaded with 4-6 value clusters, restrained tiny highlights, dark purple outlines, warm key light upper-left. Aim for excellent commercial indie pixel-art game quality, not simplistic geometric placeholders. Transparent separation between all sprites and background.
